Evidence: F003 setup-run evidence sanitization.

Setup-run evidence records capability_id, attempted steps, denied steps,
skipped human-required steps, before/after status, and next human actions. It
does not persist secret values.

Regression coverage verifies redaction across stdout/stderr, command_template,
and argv, including JWT/Bearer headers, sk_/ghp_ prefix tokens, dash-style
OpenAI keys (`sk-proj-*`), AWS access key ids, and npm registry auth-token forms
such as `_authToken=npm_*`.
